## Installation and Setup

1. Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Mohit-Badi24/javascript-nodejs-learning.git
```

2. Navigate to the project folder:

```bash
cd javascript-nodejs-learning/day-5-student-management
```

3. Run the application:

```bash
node app.js
```

## Data Storage

Student records are stored in `students.json`.

Each student contains:

- ID
- Name
- Age
- Marks

## Learning Objective

This project was developed as part of a 5-day JavaScript and Node.js learning plan to practise JavaScript functions, array methods, JSON file handling, error handling and Node.js fundamentals.